# Intelligence: routing index

Organizational knowledge: captured sources, meetings, market intel, competitive research, decisions, archive.

## Routing

| Category | Type | Goes to |
|---|---|---|
| Captured sources | Article, transcript, PDF | `Sources/YYYY-MM-DD title.md` |
| Meetings | Any meeting or call | `meetings/{topic}/` |
| Knowledge | Competitive insight | `competitors/{name}.md` |
| Knowledge | Market insight | `market/{topic}.md` |
| Knowledge | Decision with reasoning | `decisions/YYYY-MM-DD-{title}.md` |
| Archive | Completed / sunset / superseded | `archive/{name}/` |

## Rules

- Move completed projects, sunset competitors, and superseded research to `archive/`.
- Decisions specific to a single project go to `Projects/<Name>/decisions/`, not here. Cross-cutting decisions go here.
- Wikilink every entity.

